{"id":"n88349-1-13","stage":1,"title":"아홉 · 九","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n88349-1-13-1","ko":"이제 스티커를 아홉 개 모았어.","zh":"我现在已经收集到九张贴纸了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이제","meaning":"现在","explanation":"이제：现在","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58621","senseId":"1","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"스티커를","meaning":"贴纸，标签","explanation":"스티커：贴纸，标签；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"스티커","audio":"/audio/5c1e47ca08f8ac248d98.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65215","senseId":"1","lemma":"스티커","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아홉","meaning":"九","explanation":"아홉：九","readings":[{"term":"아홉","audio":"/audio/20ed618de39e3d7de102.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88349","senseId":"1","lemma":"아홉","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"개","meaning":"个","explanation":"개：个","readings":[{"term":"개","audio":"/audio/a57ab05712bfb600cb4b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22784","senseId":"1","lemma":"개","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모았어.","meaning":"收集，收藏","explanation":"모으다：收集，收藏；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"모으다","audio":"/audio/5ddf1bf1c10eabe3cc6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74137","senseId":"2","lemma":"모으다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"16ebe2403bccd648","term":"이제","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3","entryId":"58621","definition":"说话的同时。","pronunciation":["이제"]},{"id":"5c1e47ca08f8ac24","term":"스티커","zh":"贴纸，标签","audio":"/audio/5c1e47ca08f8ac248d98.mp3","entryId":"65215","definition":"正面印有字或画，反面有粘性，可以轻易贴在别的地方的东西。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"20ed618de39e3d7d","term":"아홉","zh":"九","audio":"/audio/20ed618de39e3d7de102.mp3","entryId":"88349","definition":"8加1得到的数的。","pronunciation":["아홉"]},{"id":"a57ab05712bfb600","term":"개","zh":"个","audio":"/audio/a57ab05712bfb600cb4b.mp3","entryId":"22784","defi